m:agent="v1" begin="00:39.410" end="00:41.580">I just wanna play around, boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.580" end="00:43.080" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.080" end="00:45.060">You want a temporary tattoo, don't you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.060" end="00:46.560" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.560" end="00:48.060">You wanna Wear My Kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.060" end="00:49.770">All over your body</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.770" end="00:53.490">Once you try it on, you can't live without it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.490" end="00:55.320">You wanna Wear My Kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.320" end="00:57.440">All over your lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.440" end="00:59.990">I promise you this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.990" end="01:01.490">You wanna Wear My Kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.300" end="01:02.800" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.800" end="01:04.720">Da, da, da, da-da, da, da, da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.720" end="01:09.130">Ba-da-da, da, da, da, da-da, da, da, kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.130" end="01:12.270">Da, da, da, da-da, da, da, da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.270" end="01:13.770">Ba-da-da, da, da, da, da-da, da, da, k-k-kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.650" end="01:16.280" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.280" end="01:19.860">I'm like your shoes, you like to wear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.860" end="01:23.840">Someone step on them, there's gonna be a fight in here...</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.840" end="01:27.520">So show me off, parade me around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.520" end="01:31.310">I'm like the last piece on a mannequin, just take me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.310" end="01:32.810" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.810" end="01:36.540">I'm that thing, that'll make you wanna sing (ahhh-ahhhh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.540" end="01:38.380">Take you out to buy a ring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.380" end="01:40.230">I'm not trynna settle down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.230" end="01:42.380">I just wanna play around, boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.380" end="01:43.880" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.880" end="01:46.130">You want a temporary tattoo, don't you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.130" end="01:47.630" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.630" end="01:49.070">You wanna Wear My Kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.070" end="01:50.650">All over your body</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.650" end="01:54.410">Once you try it on, you can't live without it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.410" end="01:56.290">You wanna Wear My Kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.290" end="01:58.390">All over your lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.390" end="02:00.910">I promise you this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.910" end="02:02.410">You wanna Wear My Kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.360" end="02:03.860" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.860" end="02:05.380">Da, da, da, da-da, da, da, da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.380" end="02:10.100">Ba-da-da, da, da, da, da-da, da, da, kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.100" end="02:13.290">Da, da, da, da-da, da, da, da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.290" end="02:17.620">Ba-da-da, da, da, da, da-da, da, da, k-k-kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.620" end="02:19.120" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.120" end="02:21.820">You wanna pucker up, so less I hit the door</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.820" end="02:25.710">This kiss is lethal boy, there ain't no where to go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.710" end="02:29.550">Just ask around about me, everybody knows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.550" end="02:32.570">My lipstick, make up, steal the show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.570" end="02:34.070" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.070" end="02:36.700">Da, da, da, da-da, da, da, da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.700" end="02:40.690">Yeah, oh when I aim, everybody hit the f